BOSS Scorchion Fire Orbs Orbs
    Events
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- ========================================= --------
        -------- Effect at Scorchion --------
        Special Effect - Create a special effect attached to the origin of BossScorchion using Abilities\Spells\Other\Volcano\VolcanoMissile.mdl
        Special Effect - Destroy (Last created special effect)
        -------- ========================================= --------
        -------- Create 2-4 orbs around Scorchion - Spawn locations and indications --------
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionOrbInt = (Random integer number between 2 and 4)
        -------- ========================================= --------
        For each (Integer BossScorchionOrbLoop) from 1 to BossScorchionOrbInt, do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Set VariableSet BossScorchionOrbPoint[BossScorchionOrbLoop] = ((Position of BossScorchion) offset by (Random real number between 400.00 and 800.00) towards (Random angle) degrees.)
                Special Effect - Create a special effect at BossScorchionOrbPoint[BossScorchionOrbLoop] using Abilities\Spells\Other\Doom\DoomTarget.mdl
                Set VariableSet BossScorchionOrbEffect[BossScorchionOrbLoop] = (Last created special effect)
        -------- ========================================= --------
        -------- Start spawn timer --------
        Countdown Timer - Start BossScorchionOrbTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 5.00 seconds

During the duration of fire meteors 30s, special fire orbs will appear that must all be destroyed to make the boss temporarily weaker